#: ../../upstream/docs/user/faq.rst:2
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "常见问题"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/faq.rst:14
msgid "Building and publishing your project"
msgstr "构建与发布你的项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/faq.rst:21
msgid "Why does my project have status \"failing\"?"
msgstr "为什么我的项目状态是“失败”（failing）？"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/faq.rst:23
msgid ""
"Projects have the status \"failing\" because something in the build process "
"has failed. This can be because the project is not correctly configured, "
"because the contents of the Git repository cannot be built, or in the most "
"rare cases because a system that Read the Docs connects to is not working."
msgstr ""
"项目状态为“失败”（failing）是因为构建过程中某些环节出错了。原因可能是项目配置不正确、Git 仓库内容无法构建，或（极少数情况下）Read "
"the Docs 所连接的某个系统出现故障。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/faq.rst:28
msgid ""
"First, you should check out your project's :menuselection:`Builds` tab. By "
"clicking on the failing step, you will be able to see details that can lead "
"to resolutions to your build error."
msgstr "首先，你应当查看项目的 :menuselection:`Builds` 标签页。点击失败的步骤，即可看到有助于解决构建错误的详细信息。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/faq.rst:32
msgid ""
"If the solution is not self-evident, you can use an important word or "
"message from the error to search for a solution."
msgstr "如果解决方案并不显而易见，你可以用错误信息中的关键词去搜索解决办法。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/faq.rst:37
msgid ":doc:`/guides/build-troubleshooting`"
msgstr ":doc:`/guides/build-troubleshooting`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/faq.rst:38
msgid "Common errors and solutions for build failures."
msgstr "构建失败的常见错误与解决办法。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/faq.rst:40 ../../upstream/docs/user/faq.rst:133
msgid "Other FAQ entries"
msgstr "其他 FAQ 条目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/faq.rst:41 ../../upstream/docs/user/faq.rst:134
msgid ""
":ref:`faq:How do I add additional software dependencies for my "
"documentation?`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`faq:How do I add additional software dependencies for my "
"documentation?`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/faq.rst:42
msgid ":ref:`faq:why do i get import errors from libraries depending on c modules?`"
msgstr ":ref:`faq:why do i get import errors from libraries depending on c modules?`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/faq.rst:46
msgid "Why do I get import errors from libraries depending on C modules?"
msgstr "为什么依赖 C 模块的库会报导入错误？"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/faq.rst:50
msgid "Another use case for this is when you have a module with a C extension."
msgstr "另一种适用场景是你的模块带有 C 扩展。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/faq.rst:52
msgid ""
"This happens because the build system does not have the dependencies for "
"building your project, such as C libraries needed by some Python packages "
"(e.g. ``libevent`` or ``mysql``). For libraries that cannot be "
":ref:`installed via apt <config-file/v2:build.apt_packages>` in the builder "
"there is another way to successfully build the documentation despite missing"
" dependencies."
msgstr ""
"出现这种情况是因为构建系统没有构建你的项目所需的依赖，例如某些 Python 包需要的 C 库（如 ``libevent`` 或 ``mysql`` "
"）。对于无法在构建器中 :ref:`通过 apt 安装 <config-file/v2:build.apt_packages>` "
"的库，还有一种方法可以在缺少依赖的情况下成功构建文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/faq.rst:58
msgid ""
"With Sphinx you can use the built-in `autodoc_mock_imports`_ for mocking. If"
" such libraries are installed via ``setup.py``, you also will need to remove"
" all the C-dependent libraries from your ``install_requires`` in the Read "
"the Docs environment."
msgstr ""
"在 Sphinx 中，你可以使用内置的 `autodoc_mock_imports`_ 进行模拟（mock）。如果这些库是通过 ``setup.py``"
" 安装的，你还需要在 Read the Docs 环境中从你的 ``install_requires`` 里移除所有依赖 C 的库。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/faq.rst:66
msgid "Where do I need to put my docs for Read the Docs to find it?"
msgstr "我需要把文档放在仓库的什么位置，Read the Docs 才能找到它？"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/faq.rst:68
msgid ""
"You can put your docs wherever your want on your repository. However, you "
"will need to tell Read the Docs where your Sphinx's (i.e. ``conf.py``) or "
"MkDocs' (i.e. ``mkdocs.yml``) configuration file lives in order to build "
"your documentation."
msgstr ""
"你可以把文档放在仓库中的任意位置。不过，你需要告诉 Read the Docs 你的 Sphinx（即 ``conf.py`` ）或 MkDocs（即 "
"``mkdocs.yml`` ）配置文件所在的位置，它才能构建你的文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/faq.rst:72
msgid ""
"This is done by using ``sphinx.configuration`` or ``mkdocs.configuration`` "
"config key in your Read the Docs configuration file. Read :doc:`config-"
"file/index` to know more about this."
msgstr ""
"这通过在 Read the Docs 配置文件中使用 ``sphinx.configuration`` 或 "
"``mkdocs.configuration`` 配置键来完成。欲了解更多，请阅读 :doc:`config-file/index` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/faq.rst:77
msgid "How can I avoid search results having a deprecated version of my docs?"
msgstr "如何避免搜索结果中出现我文档的已弃用版本？"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/faq.rst:79
msgid ""
"If readers search something related to your docs in Google, it will probably"
" return the most relevant version of your documentation. It may happen that "
"this version is already deprecated and you want to stop Google indexing it "
"as a result, and start suggesting the latest (or newer) one."
msgstr ""
"如果读者在 Google 中搜索与你文档相关的内容，Google 很可能返回其中最相关的那个版本。这个版本可能已经弃用，此时你会希望 Google "
"停止收录它，转而推荐最新（或较新）的版本。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/faq.rst:83
msgid ""
"To accomplish this, you can add a ``robots.txt`` file to your "
"documentation's root so it ends up served at the root URL of your project "
"(for example, https://yourproject.readthedocs.io/robots.txt). We have "
"documented how to set this up in :doc:`/reference/robots`."
msgstr ""
"为此，你可以在文档根目录添加一个 ``robots.txt`` 文件，使其最终在项目的根 URL 下提供（例如 "
"https://yourproject.readthedocs.io/robots.txt ）。我们已在 "
":doc:`/reference/robots` 中说明了设置方法。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/faq.rst:89
msgid "How do I change the version slug of my project?"
msgstr "如何更改我项目的版本 slug？"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/faq.rst:91
msgid ""
"You can change the slug of your versions from the versions tab of your "
"project, see :ref:`versions:Version URL identifier (slug)` for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"你可以在项目的“版本”（versions）标签页中更改版本的 slug，详见 :ref:`versions:Version URL identifier"
" (slug)` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/faq.rst:96
msgid "What commit of Read the Docs is in production?"
msgstr "生产环境中运行的是 Read the Docs 的哪个提交？"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/faq.rst:98
msgid ""
"We deploy readthedocs.org from the ``rel`` branch in our GitHub repository. "
"You can see the latest commits that have been deployed by looking on GitHub:"
" https://github.com/readthedocs/readthedocs.org/commits/rel"
msgstr ""
"我们从 GitHub 仓库的 ``rel`` 分支部署 readthedocs.org。你可以在 GitHub "
"上查看已部署的最新提交：https://github.com/readthedocs/readthedocs.org/commits/rel"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/faq.rst:101
msgid "We also keep an up-to-date :doc:`changelog </changelog>`."
msgstr "我们还维护着一个及时更新的 :doc:`更新日志 </changelog>` 。"

